  "title": "A connection formula between the Ramanujan function and the q-Airy function",
  "authors_raw": null,
  "abstract": "We show a connection formula between two di\ufb00erent q-Airy func- tions. One is called the Ramanujan function which appears in Ra- manujan\u2019s \u201dLost notebook\u201d. Another one is called the q-Airy function that obtained in the study of the second q-Painlev\u00b4 e equation. We use the q-Borel transformation and the q-Laplace transformation following C. Zhang to obtain the connection formula.",
